{"words": [{"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "Those who"}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "believe"}, {"text": "بِٱلْغَيْبِ", "translation": "in the unseen"}, {"text": "وَيُقِيمُونَ", "translation": "and establish"}, {"text": "ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ", "translation": "the prayer"}, {"text": "وَمِمَّا", "translation": "and out of what"}, {"text": "رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ", "translation": "We have provided them"}, {"text": "يُنفِقُونَ", "translation": "they spend"}], "sahih": "Who believe in the unseen, establish prayer,1 and spend out of what We2 have provided for them,"}